WEBVTT

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:13.240
Thank you.

00:02:14.044 --> 00:02:14.364
Bye-bye.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:15.560
Thank you.

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:30.390
Thank you.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:50.380
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.290
You untie Major Martling right away.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:54.780
No use, George.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:57.100
These savages don't understand English.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.060
What?

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:58.900
Save!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:17.200
If I had my hand untied, I'd, well, try to find Major Marley.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.270
He must be somewhere at the top of the falls.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.970
Where's that?

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:02.320
Tarzan!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:04.700
The sale.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:11.010
The book.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.640
I've lost the code book to the goddess.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.380
Look, it's safe, Tarzan.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:16.640
But how?

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.670
You dropped it when we brought you ashore.

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:23.200
But Raglan made his escape with the goddess.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.160
We saw him headed downstream in a cauca.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:28.130
Then I must hurry after him at once.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.920
What is it, Nangos? Speak English.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:37.880
Black devil, take away.

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:39.960
Señor Matlin, Señor George.

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.440
Black devil? What do you mean?

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:43.560
He means Queen Maya's monsters.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.090
The black-robed demonstrators of the high priest.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:48.500
Take your men and return to camp.

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:49.540
And you?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.700
I'm going to try to pick up their trail.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:53.070
Who's that?

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.710
Should he come, señorita?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.720
No, we're heading for the dead city.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.770
If Tarzan loses their trail, we may be able to help.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:07.750
But, senorita, those black bevels...

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.550
Never mind, hurry up.

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:53.870
What did he say, Major?

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.680
Probably posting some of his men here.

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:59.780
Watch that no one falls our trail.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.240
Well, I'd like a drink of water.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:32.420
Thank you.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:59.980
Thank you.

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:03.200
The team will lead us to Carson. Follow our trail.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:05.750
You stay with me, Nango.

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.000
Hola, Nango.

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:25.180
For the safe return of the Green Guard.

00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:28.880
You speak English. Who are you?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:39.930
does it matter once i was known in the world of science but 20 years ago i cast my lot

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:43.360
with these people and i am content

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:59.480
he demands to know where you have taken the green god tell him never have had it

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.180
It was stolen and carried away by someone else.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:05.600
Someone stopped in our party.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:19.060
You must produce the gun.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:21.850
If you fail, you die.

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:37.150
Spoken the truth.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:29.980
Thank you.

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.890
Well, it looks like I'm finished, sir.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.940
What can we tell another goddesses when we...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:45.300
We don't know.

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.520
We still have a chance.

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:50.500
Tarleton and Miss Vale may learn where we are

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:51.620
and bring help.

00:16:20.028 --> 00:16:20.368
George.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.140
See if you can untie this off.

00:16:24.668 --> 00:16:25.328
I'll try, sir.

00:16:28.124 --> 00:16:28.424
Look out.

00:16:28.668 --> 00:16:28.868
Okay.

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:36.480
No use.

00:16:36.876 --> 00:16:38.176
They're watching us too closely.
